Media capture: retain source UTC timeline mappings.

HLS program date/time is associated with the primary segment's actual
media start, without changing parser-owned timestamps. Taps receive bounded
historical anchors before buffered data and updates for new segments;
FFmpeg sources provide DateUTC. Unknown dates stay unknown.

